  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1.      The following dimensions shall be strictly followed\r\n    (c)     the distance between Wellesley House and the\r\n    Grafton Place wing will be no less than 16\r\n    metres above ground floor level.\r\n    when the building is constructed:\r\n    (a)     maximum height of Eversholt Street elevation\r\n    from the pavement:  22 metres (excluding\r\n    lift shaft)\r\n    (b)     maximum height of the Grafton Place\r\n    elevation from the pavement: 12.3 metres and\r\n    of the rear elevation from the same pavement\r\n    level: 10.7 metres.",
    "Condition : 2 - Details of the windows on the proposed north-east\r\n    elevations, which shall show how unreasonable overlooking of\r\n    neighbour can be avoided, shall be submitted to and approved\r\n    by the Council before works commence on site.",
    "Condition : 3 - The use hereby permitted shall not begin until full details of the scheme for the ventilation of and the extraction of fumes from the premises to an adequate outlet level, including details of sound attenuation for any necessary plant have been submitted to and approved by the Council and the development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given.\r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the amenities of the [adjoining] premises [and the area generally] in accordance with the requirements of policy[ies] RE2[, EN5, EN6, DS6 (and SH18 if A3 use)] of the London Borough of Camden Unitary Development Plan 2000.\r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - To safeguard the amenities of the adjoining premises and the\r\n    area generally.",
    "Condition : 5 - To safeguard the amenities of the adjoining premises and\r\n    protect residents of Wellesley House from overlooking.",
    "Condition : 6 - To safeguard the amenities of the adjoining premises and the\r\n    area generally."
